WEBVTT

00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:01.785
I like building things that work.

00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:03.225
In one project I trained a

00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:05.065
machine learning model on a 1

00:00:05.065 --> 00:00:07.224
million-row dataset, reached a

00:00:07.224 --> 00:00:09.624
test R² of 0.88 and

00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:11.624
exposed it as a REST API. Right

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:13.065
now, I'm building a credit card

00:00:13.065 --> 00:00:14.945
fraud detection model.

00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:16.625
I also use AI every day,

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:18.625
responsibly. I built a custom

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:20.505
skill that tailors my CV to each

00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:22.705
role and I always review the

00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:24.825
output. And this website itself

00:00:24.825 --> 00:00:26.530
was built with AI agents.
